{
  "$schema": "asset-customize@1",
  "_doc": "Extra editable tokens every customizable asset type gets in Settings → Appearance → Assets, on top of the fields its own asset carries. Values are saved per slot in setting axf.custom.<type> = {all, shared, byId} (all = one set of values for every asset of the type, the default; otherwise one per asset id) and apply to the active asset of the slot. Every value maps to theme tokens (colours = colour-theme tokens, sizes = multiples of the style theme), so themes still restyle everything. A token with `types` applies to those types only. `targets` = the elements each type styles (root, its items for hover/click, and `text` = text children inside the root that keep a look of their own, such as .fx-banner__logo or .fx-card__head: the type's text tokens reach them too, all but the size, which stays their own scale step). Engine: core/engines/customize.ts; icon sets in icon-sets.json. New token = one entry here + one case in customizeCss.",
  "tokens": [
    {
      "key": "fontSize",
      "label": "Font size",
      "group": "Text",
      "kind": "scale",
      "default": 100,
      "min": 60,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%"
    },
    {
